  "question": {
    "text": "<p>If the points of intersection&nbsp;of the ellipse&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and the circle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;lie on the curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to :</p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
